{"version":1,"content":"<p>一項最新古DNA研究揭示，地中海島嶼西西里在中世紀時期並非被戰爭與徵服不斷重塑人口結構的地區，而是一個長期保持高度族羣多樣性的文化交匯中心。研究發現，無論是埋葬於基督教墓地還是穆斯林墓地的人羣，其祖先來源都廣泛分佈於北非、歐洲以及整個地中海區域。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1583490.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T05:43:51.759834+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T05:37:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T05:38:06.572122+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T05:38:06.572122+00:00","content_hash":"ff5af4179ac60323c9031e5f7971801324f5fc707bc90181d0ab67b7927e7126","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}